  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Every Body Matters</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through advocacy and capacity development ensure the sport sector in Zambia is equitable, inclusive and rights based and girls and women are empowered to participate, lead and develop as active members of their communities. The project aims to promote social inclusion of persons with disabilities by expanding their access to and participation in sports. Persons with disabilities are among the project&apos;s target groups.</narrative>
  </description>
